    "Name": "Mad Dog -- Vulture",
    "Details": "The Mad Dog is a heavy Clan OmniMech used for long-range indirect fire support.  With its ample firepower and decent speed of 86.4 km/h, it makes a highly mobile firing platform, and as such has spread to near ubiquity among the forces deployed by the Clans. For its fire support purposes, the Mad Dog is armed with twin shoulder-mounted LRM-20 missile racks, which allow the 'Mech to inflict heavy damage on any opponent it may target, though limited ammo is a concern. The Mad Dog is also more than capable of going on the offensive, mounting dual large and medium-sized pulse lasers, one on each arm.",
